A known Weibo leaker has reiterated that the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a> will retain its aluminum alloy build, while issuing a specific warning that the new color options may be susceptible to paint peeling.<br/>
<br/>
